# TypeORM

TypeORM manages only the internal SchemaIQ PostgreSQL database. Never use it for dynamic customer connections. Use injected repositories, one Nest-managed runtime pool, `synchronize: false`, and reversible migrations. Do not edit migrations already deployed.
